1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
The Great Wall isn't one wall — it's 21,196 kilometers.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,300
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,100
Over 20 dynasties built their own walls across 2,000 years.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,900
A six-year survey measured every surviving stretch.

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,700
The total: 21,196 kilometers of wall and forts.

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,300
That's more than half the Earth's circumference.

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,600
The Ming stretch alone runs 8,851 kilometers.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,900
Double-tap if you'd walk a wild, empty stretch.

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: Skip Badaling's crowds — Mutianyu is quieter.

10
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Would you hike the restored wall — or the wild ruins?
